            "message": "Supported Versions Extension",
            "field": "tls.handshake.extensions.supported_version",
            "description": "Send a ClientHello message with a Supported Versions Extension that omits TLS 1.3 support (0x0304).",
            "expected_behavior": "Alert"
        }
    ]
