            "role": "client",
            "content": "Upon receiving a CertificateRequest message, the client MUST process the 'certificate_authorities' extension to determine the certificate authorities that are accepted by the server. If the extension is absent, the client MAY continue the handshake considering no specific certificate authorities are preferred by the server."
        }
    }
}

