            "content": "Upon receiving the ClientHello, server MUST verify that none of the proposed AEAD algorithms in ciphersuites have N_MAX less than 8 bytes. If such an algorithm is detected, server MUST abort the handshake with the 'illegal_parameter' alert."
        }
    }
}

